From 12abafd0ffbd37ab5f88be075cc6c58258f37194 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:26:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [ofono] Add logical channels to the eUICC's ISD-R

A local profile assistant such as lpac needs logical channels to the
ISD-R to manage eSIM profiles. oFono owns the modem, so add an interface
org.plinius.ofono.EuiccChannel with Open, Transmit and Close. It only
accepts ISD-R AIDs (SGP.22), so it cannot reach the USIM. One client at a
time owns the channels; they are closed when it leaves the bus.

A request the driver does not answer within 30 s (the card restarts
after a profile switch and the request gets lost) fails with TimedOut,
so the interface does not stay busy for good.
